line	
line	<str>Go back to the Lunar Isle.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>North-west in the city, talk to <col=800000>Pauline Polaris</col> (1 inventory space required) Note: The chat options appear in a random order when guessing her real name. First guess must be Pauline. Pick the option that says "Jane Blud-Hagic-Maid."</col>
